mation and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_8"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"content": "engenn5le05ob08re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Ask and Say Where Places Are", "type": "heading"}, {"content": " ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Here are some example questions and answers.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":8,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Ask Where Places Are\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Say Where Places Are\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Can you tell me where the monastery is?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"It's about a twenty-minute walk east of here.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Could you tell me where the donkeys are?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"They are tied up near the hotel.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I'd like to know where the ticket office is.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"It's across the road from the restaurant.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Could anyone tell me where to find the tourist office?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"It's in the center of town.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I don't suppose you would know where the tour starts?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"It starts in the entrance hall.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I wonder if you could tell me where I can get a souvenir?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"The souvenir shop is down the street.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Would you happen to know where I could find a bathroom?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"The public bathrooms are inside the building.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "basin", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a large area of the earth's surface that is lower than the area around it ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Petra is is located in a large basin.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le05ob08aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "These are words you use to describe Petra.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "treasury", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the place where a government keeps its money", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The treasury building is stunning.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le05ob08aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to fast", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to eat no food for a period of time", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Muslims fast during Ramadan.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le05ob08aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Ramadan", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a time when Muslims refrain from consuming food, drinking liquids and smoking in the daytime", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Ramadan happens once a year.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le05ob08aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Muslim", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a follower of the religion of Islam", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Muslims often make a pilgrimage to Mecca.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le05ob08aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to smoke", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to suck the smoke from a cigarette", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Muslims do not smoke during Ramadan.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le05ob08aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Research the city of Petra in Jordan.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write a paragraph that describes what you see.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Use paragraph structure.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Use adjectives to make your ideas come alive!", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Read your paragraph to a partner.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I research famous ancient cities.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I write a paragraph on Petra.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I proofread my work.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I read my paragraph aloud.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"contents": [{}], "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "id": 0, "type": "welcome"}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "audio", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"image": "engenn5le05ob08re2img01.jpg", "time": "0", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"image": "engenn5le05ob08re2img01.jpg", "time": "100", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Nice photos! Can you tell me where Petra is again?</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: It lies in a basin along the mountains in southern Jordan.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: The monastery and treasury are carved out of stone, right?</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:  Yes, it's incredible!"}, {"image": "engenn5le05ob08re2img03.jpg", "time": "14000", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: How far is it from the town center?</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: It's a 20-minute walk through the desert.  You can ride a camel, donkey or horse around the area.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Wow, I'm missing out on a lot.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:  It'll be 2050 before you get to travel."}, {"image": "engenn5le05ob08re2img05.jpg", "time": "30000", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: I have to work, remember? Maybe I might go to Petra in May, after I save enough money.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Ah, but this year the holy fast of Ramadan is in May. During this month, Muslims mustn't eat, drink, or smoke during the day."}, {"image": "engenn5le05ob08re2img05.jpg", "time": "45500", "id": 4, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: And tourists?</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Tourists mustn't eat, drink, or smoke in public places.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: I may go in June instead."}], "audiosrc": "engenn5le05ob08re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn5le05ob08re2img01.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "id": 3}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "video", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"image": "", "time": "0", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"image": "", "time": "8000", "id": 1, "text": "Describing Where Places Are"}, {"image": "", "time": "21000", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"bullet\">ask where places are"}, {"image": "", "time": "34000", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"bullet\">say where places are"}], "video_src": "engenn5le05ob08re3vid01"}, "type": "video"}], "id": 4}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "I can talk about buildings and structures.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "I can ask and say where places are in a country.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "I can talk about things, actions and events in the future.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "Where would you like to travel in the Middle East?", "typ